# Du lieu va model (dung LFS hoac luu ngoai repo)
# `data/` chi khop THU MUC. File nen nhu data.zip van lot qua -> phai bat rieng.
# GitHub tu choi file > 100 MB o phia server, va luc do commit da tao roi nen
# phai sua lai lich su chu khong chi them dong vao day.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
data/
datasets/
models/*
weights/
checkpoints/
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.engine
*.plan
*.onnx

# NGOAI LE: artifact deploy. File .onnx trong models/ chi 1-2 MB va la thu THAT
# SU chay tren xe - phai truy nguoc duoc ve dung commit, va de Jetson lay bang
# `git pull` thay vi scp. Dong phu dinh phai nam SAU `*.onnx` o tren thi moi
# thang (gitignore lay quy tac khop CUOI CUNG).
# `.engine` van bi chan: no gan chat thiet bi, chep sang may khac la vo dung.
!models/*.onnx
*.tflite
*.torchscript

